WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.625
In this verse, Lord Krishna continues

2
00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:31.791
the discussion of different

3
00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:34.541
levels of devotion and practice,

4
00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:37.000
and describes a simple

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.500
and progressive path

6
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.625
for those who find it difficult

7
00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.541
to connect with devotion immediately.

8
00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:51.125
Lord Krishna presents here

9
00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.750
a very clear

10
00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:55.583
and structured path for spiritual progress,

11
00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:58.250
where every person, whatever

12
00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.375
their capacity,

13
00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:02.583
can move forward according to their own level.

14
00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:05.458
He explains that if one cannot

15
00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:08.666
practise pure devotion, the next good option is

16
00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:12.416
developing spiritual knowledge,

17
00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:14.916
called brahma-jnana.

18
00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:17.250
And better than this spiritual knowledge is

19
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.791
meditation done with single-pointed focus.

20
00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:21.750
And better even than meditation is

21
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.625
the renunciation of the fruits of one's actions,

22
00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:26.208
done with a feeling of

23
00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:28.500
devotion toward Lord Krishna,

24
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:32.166
as described in verse 12.10.

25
00:01:32.166 --> 00:01:35.125
One thing is important to understand here.

26
00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:38.541
The karma-phala-tyaga mentioned here

27
00:01:38.541 --> 00:01:41.083
is not merely giving up attachment,

28
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:44.708
as described in verse 12.11.

29
00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:47.458
Rather, it is the renunciation of
the fruits of action.

30
00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:49.000
Fully offering the fruits of one's

31
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.916
actions to Lord Krishna.

32
00:01:51.916 --> 00:01:54.500
Performing every action with the feeling

33
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.708
that all its fruits will be dedicated to Him.

34
00:01:57.708 --> 00:02:00.958
As if we are acting only for Him.

35
00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:04.708
Such renunciation gives inner peace.

36
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:06.416
In Chapter 5, verse 29,

37
00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:07.541
this formula

38
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:10.166
for peace was also given.

39
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:13.000
In this way, by presenting these different levels,

40
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.125
Lord Krishna ensures

41
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:17.875
that every being has a meaningful path

42
00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:21.750
to move toward devotion and surrender.

43
00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.875
Let us understand once more the levels

44
00:02:24.875 --> 00:02:28.041
described in Chapter 12 so far.

45
00:02:28.041 --> 00:02:30.500
The highest path is fixing both mind

46
00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.375
and intellect in Lord Krishna,

47
00:02:33.375 --> 00:02:35.750
as described in verse 12.8.

48
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.666
Then verse 12.9 describes

49
00:02:37.666 --> 00:02:40.666
that if such devotion is hard, abhyasa yoga,

50
00:02:40.666 --> 00:02:42.750
regularly practising the

51
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.916
activities of devotion.

52
00:02:44.916 --> 00:02:47.541
If that is not possible, then engage

53
00:02:47.541 --> 00:02:50.750
in activities dedicated to Lord Krishna,

54
00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.833
as verse 12.10 describes.

55
00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:54.500
If even

56
00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.166
that is not possible, the path of
meditation should be adopted,

57
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:00.958
as verse 12.12 describes.

58
00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:03.000
If meditation is also not possible,

59
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.708
then brahma-jnana, that is,

60
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:08.125
understanding the distinction
between body and soul.

61
00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:10.750
And if even that is not possible,

62
00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.125
then a person should

63
00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.000
act with detachment

64
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.958
toward a good purpose.

65
00:03:17.958 --> 00:03:21.916
If the order described here is confusing you,

66
00:03:21.916 --> 00:03:24.000
or seems a little contrary

67
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.625
to other parts of the Gita,

68
00:03:25.625 --> 00:03:27.916
then understand it once more, deeply.

69
00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:31.916
Grasping the essence of this
order is most essential.

70
00:03:36.625 --> 00:03:40.875
When life feels tangled,

71
00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:43.041
and the mind finds it

72
00:03:43.041 --> 00:03:45.625
hard to find peace,

73
00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:48.583
what do you do?

74
00:03:48.583 --> 00:03:49.833
Often

75
00:03:49.833 --> 00:03:53.041
people first turn to knowledge,

76
00:03:53.041 --> 00:03:54.666
they read books,

77
00:03:54.666 --> 00:03:57.375
listen to teachings,

78
00:03:57.375 --> 00:04:00.291
try to understand

79
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:03.125
why there is so much restlessness.

80
00:04:03.125 --> 00:04:05.166
And for a while,

81
00:04:05.166 --> 00:04:08.416
all of this helps.

82
00:04:08.416 --> 00:04:11.041
Like a cool breeze

83
00:04:11.041 --> 00:04:16.375
in the heat.

84
00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:17.750
But

85
00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:21.958
this experience does not last long.

86
00:04:21.958 --> 00:04:23.458
After some time,

87
00:04:23.458 --> 00:04:26.958
the same worries return.

88
00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:31.041
Now some people go deeper.

89
00:04:31.041 --> 00:04:34.541
They sit with their own thoughts.

90
00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:38.708
They try to understand the state of the mind.

91
00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:41.125
They meditate,

92
00:04:41.125 --> 00:04:43.375
and from here comes

93
00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:46.708
a clearer perspective,

94
00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:49.791
what the real problem actually is.

95
00:04:49.791 --> 00:04:52.750
And when the right perspective comes,

96
00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:56.250
a deep peace is felt.

97
00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.125
But

98
00:04:58.125 --> 00:05:00.208
is this peace

99
00:05:00.208 --> 00:05:02.958
permanent?

100
00:05:02.958 --> 00:05:05.666
Not entirely.

101
00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:11.125
Because we are still connected to thoughts,

102
00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:14.250
and thoughts are temporary.

103
00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:18.333
After some time a difficult situation

104
00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:20.458
will shake them again.

105
00:05:20.458 --> 00:05:23.291
True peace is not in thinking,

106
00:05:23.291 --> 00:05:25.958
or in thoughts.

107
00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.250
It is in doing.

108
00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.125
When you do your work

109
00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:34.250
without expecting any fruit,

110
00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.291
when you hold sincerity in your action

111
00:05:37.291 --> 00:05:41.000
without any selfishness,

112
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.750
then a peace awakens within you

113
00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:48.500
that never wavers,

114
00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:52.041
because action is necessary.

115
00:05:52.041 --> 00:05:56.833
It gives direction to the mind and the intellect.

116
00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:00.458
But now if there is no selfishness,

117
00:06:00.458 --> 00:06:04.375
what worry is there about the result?

118
00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:07.500
And if there is no fear of the result,

119
00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.833
peace will not waver.

120
00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:13.041
May you experience

121
00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:15.750
such lasting peace,

122
00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:18.958
this is my wish for you.

123
00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.625
Do you also feel that

124
00:06:26.625 --> 00:06:28.708
accumulating wealth,

125
00:06:28.708 --> 00:06:32.125
property, or comforts,

126
00:06:32.125 --> 00:06:35.958
and holding on to them,

127
00:06:35.958 --> 00:06:39.208
will bring true peace?

128
00:06:39.208 --> 00:06:42.208
Many people think that
accumulating more wealth

129
00:06:42.208 --> 00:06:45.666
and property will bring security,

130
00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:50.083
and that this security is the only way to peace.

131
00:06:50.083 --> 00:06:52.500
But if that were so,

132
00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:58.916
every wealthy person's mind would be at peace.

133
00:06:58.916 --> 00:07:03.000
The truth is that true peace

134
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:07.708
is not connected to wealth and property.

135
00:07:07.708 --> 00:07:11.000
True peace does not lie in the things

136
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:14.583
you are accumulating.

137
00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:18.625
True peace comes from the thinking

138
00:07:18.625 --> 00:07:22.125
that is in your mind.

139
00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:27.291
If your mind is always tied to the result,

140
00:07:27.291 --> 00:07:30.625
if there is a constant fear of losing something,

141
00:07:30.625 --> 00:07:33.250
or an attachment

142
00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:36.500
to gaining more,

143
00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.250
then

144
00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:41.625
how will peace come?

145
00:07:41.625 --> 00:07:43.875
Peace comes

146
00:07:43.875 --> 00:07:46.958
when you do your duty

147
00:07:46.958 --> 00:07:49.833
with full sincerity,

148
00:07:49.833 --> 00:07:52.875
but free yourself from the result,

149
00:07:52.875 --> 00:07:58.583
do not become attached to it,

150
00:07:58.583 --> 00:08:00.541
and leave it with Me.

151
00:08:00.541 --> 00:08:04.375
Give your family full love,

152
00:08:04.375 --> 00:08:08.583
serve them, care for them,

153
00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:12.458
but do not try to control family members,

154
00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:18.416
or the results of your love and service.

155
00:08:18.416 --> 00:08:20.125
because those results

156
00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:24.333
do not depend only on you.

157
00:08:24.333 --> 00:08:26.875
Your service and love

158
00:08:26.875 --> 00:08:31.208
are only one part of that result.

159
00:08:31.208 --> 00:08:35.791
That part you must do with your whole heart.

160
00:08:35.791 --> 00:08:40.750
Remember, giving up control or attachment

161
00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:44.333
is not turning away from duty,

162
00:08:44.333 --> 00:08:48.583
but rather doing your duty with full sincerity

163
00:08:48.583 --> 00:08:52.458
and a light heart.

164
00:08:52.458 --> 00:08:55.583
Understand this yourself, and help your

165
00:08:55.583 --> 00:09:00.833
family understand it too,
but not just by saying it,

166
00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:05.666
rather through your conduct and behaviour

167
00:09:05.666 --> 00:09:09.166
Do not tell them, show them

168
00:09:09.166 --> 00:09:12.666
that action done with sincerity

169
00:09:12.666 --> 00:09:16.000
and without attachment makes life

170
00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.916
beautiful and joyful.

171
00:09:22.708 --> 00:09:24.625
When your colleagues

172
00:09:24.625 --> 00:09:28.458
do not meet your expectations,

173
00:09:28.458 --> 00:09:33.916
do you feel disappointed or irritated?

174
00:09:33.916 --> 00:09:35.458
Does it feel that

175
00:09:35.458 --> 00:09:40.625
if you lower your standard of excellence,

176
00:09:40.625 --> 00:09:43.958
everything will fall apart?

177
00:09:43.958 --> 00:09:47.000
I, Krishna.

178
00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.041
I too wish the best

179
00:09:50.041 --> 00:09:53.916
life for you.

180
00:09:53.916 --> 00:09:57.958
This goal of excellence remains firm,

181
00:09:57.958 --> 00:10:03.125
but I never become disheartened with anyone.

182
00:10:03.125 --> 00:10:05.666
Wherever you are,

183
00:10:05.666 --> 00:10:10.791
my purpose is to lift you up from there.

184
00:10:10.791 --> 00:10:14.625
I do not reject anyone.

185
00:10:14.625 --> 00:10:18.750
I give everyone a path

186
00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.750
that leads them gradually

187
00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:25.166
toward spiritual progress.

188
00:10:25.166 --> 00:10:26.875
Now this same perspective

189
00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:31.166
you too can adopt at your workplace.

190
00:10:31.166 --> 00:10:34.041
Keep your goal clear,

191
00:10:34.041 --> 00:10:37.041
maintain the demand for excellence,

192
00:10:37.041 --> 00:10:41.083
but to reach that goal

193
00:10:41.083 --> 00:10:43.458
also build a system.

194
00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:47.333
A system that motivates people,

195
00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:49.333
and offers them support.

196
00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:53.250
Some need knowledge or training,

197
00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.833
some need guidance, and some

198
00:10:55.833 --> 00:11:00.041
just need your time and encouragement.

199
00:11:00.041 --> 00:11:02.750
Give all of these.

200
00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.541
True leadership is not that all

201
00:11:05.541 --> 00:11:09.458
colleagues become the best.

202
00:11:09.458 --> 00:11:11.708
True leadership is that

203
00:11:11.708 --> 00:11:12.958
everyone

204
00:11:12.958 --> 00:11:16.916
receives the inspiration to
walk the path of progress.

205
00:11:16.916 --> 00:11:21.041
When you show the goal, explain the path,

206
00:11:21.041 --> 00:11:24.500
walk alongside, offer support,

207
00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.458
then this organisation

208
00:11:26.458 --> 00:11:30.958
moves together toward an extraordinary success,

209
00:11:30.958 --> 00:11:33.958
and achieves it.

210
00:11:33.958 --> 00:11:35.833
Reflect on this.
